{
  "_comment": [
    "Drop into ~/.claude/settings.json (or merge with your existing config).",
    "Prefer generating this with wire.py, which validates hook coverage and",
    "warns when a subset of the ACS-Core minimum is wired \u2014 this file IS",
    "wire.py's output for the placeholder arguments below (asserted by",
    "tests/test_example_config.py; PR #22 review: the previous example",
    "passed every setting through a per-hook `env` object that Claude Code",
    "does not implement, so a copied config ran unsigned, fail-open, with",
    "no audit sink \u2014 all env vars now ride inline in the command string,",
    "the only channel Claude Code passes through).",
    "",
    "Replace ACS_GUARDIAN_URL with your deployment's endpoint and the",
    "/path/to/ placeholders with real absolute paths.",
    "",
    "ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE: REQUIRED for ACS-Core baseline integrity (\u00a710).",
    "Without a secret both ends run unsigned and any local process that",
    "binds the Guardian port first becomes the Guardian. Generate one:",
    "  mkdir -p ~/.acs && openssl rand -hex 32 > ~/.acs/hmac.key && chmod 600 ~/.acs/hmac.key",
    "and give the SAME file to the Guardian.",
    "",
    "ACS_AUDIT_FILE: where \u00a76.4 audit events land durably. Hook-process",
    "stderr is collected by nothing; this file is the audit half of the",
    "fail-open trade.",
    "",
    "ACS_DEFAULT_DENY=1 is set on the GATE hooks (PreToolUse,",
    "UserPromptSubmit \u2014 the ones whose verdict blocks an action, per",
    "wire.py GATE_HOOKS). Observational hooks fail open per the \u00a76.4",
    "default. Incident kill switch: set ACS_DISABLED=1 to bypass all",
    "hooks immediately."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log python3 /path/to/acs_adapter.py # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_DEFAULT_DENY=1 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log python3 /path/to/acs_adapter.py # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_DEFAULT_DENY=1 ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log python3 /path/to/acs_adapter.py # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log python3 /path/to/acs_adapter.py # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Notification": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log python3 /path/to/acs_adapter.py # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log python3 /path/to/acs_adapter.py # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log python3 /path/to/acs_adapter.py # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "ACS_GUARDIAN_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787/acs ACS_HMAC_SECRET_FILE=/path/to/.acs/hmac.key ACS_AUDIT_FILE=/path/to/.acs/audit.log python3 /path/to/acs_adapter.py # acs-adapter-wired"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
